/-!
# Source-generated dilation readback on the Müntz Riesz vector

The actual normalized positive dilation acts on every lawful quarter-Mellin
test carrier.  Pairing the dilated canonical unit-coordinate shell with the
Riesz vector generated by the Müntz quotient reads the exact half-density
character.  This is a constitutive readback, not a stationarity or no-flux
claim.
-/

set_option autoImplicit false
set_option maxHeartbeats 3000000

namespace SaturationMonoid
namespace ResponsibilityLifecycle
namespace LivingLawEvolution
namespace ConstructiveRoot
namespace NoIslandNoMagic
